### 2.15 sales_trend exists upstream (dashboard.py:555) -> a line chart; the port never built it (finding 20)
# @expect $.message.error absent
# @expect $.message.series exists
POST {{host}}/api/method/{{dash}}.get_chart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "sales_trend", "type": "axis", "from_date": "2026-01-01", "to_date": "2026-12-31"}

### 2.16 funnel_conversion, likewise (dashboard.py:736) -> finding 20
